MANIFEST

# Gemini/IDE Artifacts
.gemini/
brain/
scratch/*
!scratch/generate_benchmark_full.py
!scratch/status_check.py
# docs/ is ignored, so the conflict demonstration pair ships as its generator instead.
!scratch/make_conflict_docs.py
# Volume benchmark; the numbers it produces back the scaling claim, so it ships with them.
!scratch/loadtest.py
# Regression suite for the four demo queries; every build-plan phase runs this to gate itself.
!scratch/regress.py
# Phase 3 ingestion script; documents how GovDocsV2 was populated.
!scratch/ingest_department.py
# Pre-flight probe. It reads LOCAL_EMBED_URL/LOCAL_RERANK_URL/TRANSLATION_SERVICE_URL, which
# in a distributed deployment are private addresses, so it has to run on the application host
# rather than a laptop. Untracked, it existed only on the machine it could not be run from.
!scratch/preflight.py
# One-time backfill: tags pre-existing GovDocs chunks with a department, for the token
# security-groups feature. Documents how the live corpus was migrated onto it.
!scratch/backfill_department.py
# Read-only check of supersedes/references extraction hit-rate against real department text,
# meant to be run before ingesting a new department, not just once.
!scratch/validate_relations.py
# One-time backfill: re-runs the improved supersedes/references extraction against the
# already-ingested corpus. Documents how the live citation graph was repaired.
!scratch/backfill_relations.py
# The actual bulk-ingestion driver for all 32 department folders - long-running and meant to
# be restarted across sessions, not a one-off script.
!scratch/ingest_all_departments.py

# Testing and Logs
*.log
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

